Retain the generated board artwork and restore the idle tty1 branding on
late framebuffer creation, VT return and real Rockchip HPD events. Keep text,
blanking and graphics ownership intact, and use the negotiated viewport when
reusing a framebuffer. This patch is carried only by the CX3576 board kernel.

Base: armbian/linux-rockchip c6157104418d012823413c02f9222f3fe123dd25

